{"id": "61212", "title": "拦截爱情", "author": "林悦", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/61/61212.htm", "intro": "属性分类：现代／其他／一般言情／感动揪心\r\n\r\n关键字：主角 　柳玟琪 　刘晏 \r\n\r\n文案：\r\n\r\n我不需要你爱我，只要你好好的，她好好的就好\r\n这样我就能勇敢的生活著\r\n\r\n只要我想，只要我爱，没什麽不可能的\r\n相信我，尽管相信我，你会看见我的真心", "base": "files/article/html/61/61212", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9009143.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "9009148.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-14", "file": "9009149.html", "available": false}, {"title": "15-18", "file": "9009150.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-22", "file": "9009152.html", "available": false}, {"title": "23-26", "file": "9009154.html", "available": false}, {"title": "27-30", "file": "9009155.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "9009156.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40完结", "file": "9009159.html", "available": false}]}